Data in data/ is derived from the FlyWire connectome (Dorkenwald et al. 2024),
FlyWire annotations (Schlegel et al. 2024) and the model inputs of Shiu et al. 2024
(MIT). See README.md for citations. vendor/three is three.js (MIT, see vendor/three/LICENSE).
